      "side": 1,
      "message": "We have a single cache, but potentially multiple partitions? That seems super odd. We\u0027re mutating the nvmem_cache for NVMEM_NUM_PARTITONS?",
      "revId": "e6be934ab9c87c999b11bb1e875d762c173cca43",
